# Files behind the compute-lane studies that are NOT in this directory: raw receipts (request/response logs,
# per-boot snapshots, telemetry, run state, step logs, caches, large reports), the engine-source snapshot used by
# the declaration-control dispatch proof, superseded/duplicate kit copies, and byte-identical duplicates of files
# that ARE included. Columns (TAB-separated): sha256, size in bytes, original path, category.
# Original paths are relative to a named source root; internal agent names and host names in path components
# were replaced the same way as in file contents (e.g. a leading agent-name prefix such as "<name>-stdbench-" is
# written "stdbench-"). sha256 "UNREADABLE" = root-owned file not readable by the publishing account (size only).
